@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 01 - Crear embarque (esperado: 201, CREATED, 2 contenedores vacíos y 2 documentos)
# @name createShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Buenos Aires, Argentina",
  "destination": "Montevideo, Uruguay",
  "containers": [
    { "reference": "CONT-REST-001" },
    { "reference": "CONT-REST-002" }
  ],
  "documents": [
    { "type": "COMMERCIAL_INVOICE", "reference": "INV-REST-001" },
    { "type": "PACKING_LIST", "reference": "PL-REST-001" }
  ]
}

### 02 - Agregar ítem al segundo contenedor (esperado: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{createShipment.response.body.$.id}}/containers/{{createShipment.response.body.$.containers[1].id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Repuestos industriales",
  "quantity": 24
}

### 03 - Consultar embarque y comprobar pertenencia (esperado: 200; primer contenedor vacío y segundo con 1 ítem)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{createShipment.response.body.$.id}}

### 04 - Crear segundo embarque para prueba de pertenencia (esperado: 201)
# @name createSecondShipment
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Rosario, Argentina",
  "destination": "Asunción, Paraguay",
  "containers": [
    { "reference": "CONT-REST-003" }
  ],
  "documents": [
    { "type": "COMMERCIAL_INVOICE", "reference": "INV-REST-002" },
    { "type": "PACKING_LIST", "reference": "PL-REST-002" }
  ]
}

### 05 - Rechazar contenedor de otro embarque (esperado: 404, CONTAINER_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{createShipment.response.body.$.id}}/containers/{{createSecondShipment.response.body.$.containers[0].id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "No debe agregarse",
  "quantity": 1
}

### 06 - Comprobar que el rechazo no mutó el embarque (esperado: 200; estado igual al request 03)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{createShipment.response.body.$.id}}

### 07 - Rechazar creación sin contenedores (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR o BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "origin": "Buenos Aires, Argentina",
  "destination": "Montevideo, Uruguay",
  "containers": [],
  "documents": [
    { "type": "COMMERCIAL_INVOICE", "reference": "INV-REST-INVALID" },
    { "type": "PACKING_LIST", "reference": "PL-REST-INVALID" }
  ]
}

### 08 - Rechazar cantidad cero (esperado: 400, VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shipments/{{createShipment.response.body.$.id}}/containers/{{createShipment.response.body.$.containers[1].id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Cantidad inválida",
  "quantity": 0
}

### 09 - Responder 404 para embarque inexistente (esperado: 404, SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shipments/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999
